---
layout: page.liquid
title: Blog
description: Notes on .NET, architecture and side projects from Henrik Becker.
permalink: /blog/
---
{% assign posts = collections.posts | reverse %}
{% if posts.size > 0 %}
<ul class="post-list">
  {% for post in posts %}
  <li>
    <time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
    <div>
      <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
      {% if post.data.description %}<p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>{% endif %}
    </div>
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>
{% else %}
<p>Writing is on its way. Notes on .NET, architecture and the side projects — including the parts that went sideways.</p>
<p>Until then, the <a href="/#projects">side projects</a> are the best place to see what I've been up to.</p>
{% endif %}
